          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi ni yo mice y’uruvyaro rwa Aroni:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Aroni bari Nadabu, Abihu, Eliyazeri na Itamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Nadabu na Abihu batanze se gupfa, kandi nta bahungu basize. Nuko Eliyazeri na Itamari baciye bakora nk’abaherezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi abashira mu migwi yisunze ivyo bazokora n’urutonde bari bakwiye gukorerako, afashijwe na Sadoki akomoka kuri Eliyazeri na Ahimeleki akomoka kuri Itamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarongozi benshi bavuye mu ruvyaro rwa Eliyazeri kuruta abavuye mu rwa Itamari, maze bashirwa mu migwi bisunze ico nyene: abakuru b’amazu bava mu bakomoka kuri Eliyazeri bari cumi na batandatu, hanyuma abakuru b’amazu bava ku bakomoka kuri Itamari bari umunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babagabuye mu migwi y’ibikorwa batarenganije n’umwe kuko bakoresheje ubupfindo. Ivyo vyatumwe n’uko hariho benshi bari babereye gukora mu Ingoro y’Imana bava mu bakomoka kuri Eliyazeri na Itamari bompi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwanditsi Shemaya mwene Netaneli Umulewi, yanditse amazina yabo ari imbere y’umwami n’abakuru bose: Sadoki umuherezi, Ahimeleki mwene Abiyatari n’abakuru b’amazu y’abaherezi n’Abalewi, bagafata umwe wo mu nzu kwa Eliyazeri hanyuma uwundi wo mu nzu kwa Itamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urwo ni rwo rutonde bakurikiza mu gukora igikorwa c’Imana iyo baramukiwe kwinjira mu ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", bisunze amategeko yabagenga yashizweho na sekuru wabo Aroni kandi nk’uko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana y’Abisirayeli, yari yaramutegetse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
